The legal text is the Saint Christopher and Nevis Constitution Order 1983 (SI 1983/881), as made, from legislation.gov.uk.

  Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0.
  https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/
  Source: https://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/1983/881/made (scanned PDF), retrieved 30 October 2026.

Changes made by Lexifina: the page images were converted to text by optical character recognition (Tesseract 5.4); marginal notes, headers and chapter headings were left out; a few misread words were corrected by hand; and the text was arranged as one Markdown file per provision and as git commits. Neither the National Archives nor the Government of Saint Kitts and Nevis endorses this repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
